Content:
As the saying goes; 
Men are afraid women will laugh at them. Women are afraid men will kill them.
Most men simply do not understand the kind of shit women have to put up with on a daily basis. It's no real wonder a lot of women choose to stream as Vtubers nowadays. Even then it's not a guarantee of safety. I remember a story from two or so months ago where a guy put a tracker in a present that he left for a Vtuber after a meet and greet at a convention. Then used it to find her house and tried to break in with a sledgehammer, while she was live at the time.
